menu "Pajoniiir UI migration"
config PAJONIIIR_DJ_OVERVIEW
    bool "Use dj_ui presentation (migration preview)"
    depends on LV_USE_CUSTOM_MALLOC
    default n
    help
        Incremental package H migration. Overview, Library and Hot Cues use dj_ui
        presentation and existing transport/library state. Settings still
        use the qualified legacy presentation until their parity gates pass.
        This is a development preview, not hardware acceptance.
        All LVGL allocations use the custom PSRAM heap so small widgets and
        labels cannot consume internal memory needed by USB and Wi-Fi tasks.
endmenu
